                                    Style="{StaticResource StudioMuted}"
                                    TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                    Text="Skip group photos, a child or pet in front of you, full-body landscapes, over-the-shoulder shots, and chat thumbnails. Make live version only locks a face the finder can see. A 1–2 minute sitting of you talking is stronger than stills. Photos is the family album; this room is likeness." />
